error[E0910]: `twice` returns `Code`, but it is a `def`, not a `macro def`
  --> tests/ui/def_returns_code_calls.wid:11:1
   |
11 | def twice(e: Code) -> Code
   | ^^^ `twice` is declared as a method the program runs
12 |   quote do
   |   -------- a `quote` builds code only inside a `macro def`
   = note: a `macro def` runs while compiling, and the code its `quote` builds replaces each call; `Code` exists only then
help: make `twice` a macro
   | macro def twice(e: Code) -> Code
   = see `wid explain E0910`

